From: j7prime p2 <p2@j7prime.invalid>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 15:53:23 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] dt-bindings: thermal: samsung,exynos-thermal: add
 Exynos7870 TMU

The Exynos7870 has one TMU block (TEM1455X sensor) at 0x10130000 which
needs six CMU_PERI gates: the APB clocks of the CPUCL0, CPUCL1 and TMU
register files and the three matching sensor clocks. The driver keeps
all of them enabled for the life of the device (gating one of them
while the block is live hangs the interconnect).

Document the compatible and its six clocks, so that the SoC DT node
added later in this series validates.

Origin: j7prime p2 series (new for 7.3.4); clock list as used by
Alessandro Fontana's linux-exynos7870 gtaxlwifi/7.3 exynos7870.dtsi.
Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
---

Notes:
    Origin: new in the j7prime p2 series for v7.3.4 (see the Origin line in the message).

 .../thermal/samsung,exynos-thermal.yaml       | 31 +++++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 29 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/samsung,exynos-thermal.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/samsung,exynos-thermal.yaml
index 3f333db..881af78 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/samsung,exynos-thermal.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/samsung,exynos-thermal.yaml
@@ -27,14 +27,15 @@ properties:
       - samsung,exynos5420-tmu-ext-triminfo
       - samsung,exynos5433-tmu
       - samsung,exynos7-tmu
+      - samsung,exynos7870-tmu
 
   clocks:
     minItems: 1
-    maxItems: 3
+    maxItems: 6
 
   clock-names:
     minItems: 1
-    maxItems: 3
+    maxItems: 6
 
   interrupts:
     description: |
@@ -120,6 +121,32 @@ allOf:
           minItems: 1
           maxItems: 1
 
+  - if:
+      properties:
+        compatible:
+          contains:
+            const: samsung,exynos7870-tmu
+    then:
+      properties:
+        clocks:
+          items:
+            - description: APB clock of the CPUCL0 sensor registers.
+            - description: APB clock of the CPUCL1 sensor registers.
+            - description: APB clock of the TMU block.
+            - description: Special clock of the CPUCL0 sensor.
+            - description: Special clock of the CPUCL1 sensor.
+            - description: Special clock of the TMU block.
+        clock-names:
+          items:
+            - const: tmu_cpucl0_apbif
+            - const: tmu_cpucl1_apbif
+            - const: tmu_apbif
+            - const: tmu_cpucl0_sclk
+            - const: tmu_cpucl1_sclk
+            - const: tmu_sclk
+        reg:
+          maxItems: 1
+
   - if:
       properties:
         compatible:
